## AnimatedVisibility

`AnimatedVisibility` 控制 Composable 的显示和隐藏动画。

```kotlin
@Composable
fun NotificationBanner(
    message: String,
    isVisible: Boolean,
    onDismiss: () -> Unit
) {
    AnimatedVisibility(
        visible = isVisible,
        enter = slideInVertically(initialOffsetY = { -it }) + fadeIn(),
        exit = slideOutVertically(targetOffsetY = { -it }) + fadeOut()
    ) {
        Card(
            modifier = Modifier
                .fillMaxWidth()
                .padding(16.dp),
            colors = CardDefaults.cardColors(
                containerColor = MaterialTheme.colorScheme.primaryContainer
            )
        ) {
            Row(
                modifier = Modifier.padding(16.dp),
                verticalAlignment = Alignment.CenterVertically
            ) {
                Icon(Icons.Default.Info, contentDescription = null)
                Spacer(modifier = Modifier.width(8.dp))
                Text(text = message, modifier = Modifier.weight(1f))
                IconButton(onClick = onDismiss) {
                    Icon(Icons.Default.Close, contentDescription = "关闭")
                }
            }
        }
    }
}
```

```mermaid
graph TD
    A[AnimatedVisibility] --> B{visible = true?}
    B -->|true| C[执行 Enter 动画]
    B -->|false| D[执行 Exit 动画]
    C --> E[显示内容]
    D --> F[隐藏并移除内容]

    subgraph Enter 效果
        G[fadeIn]
        H[slideIn]
        I[expandIn]
        J[scaleIn]
    end

    subgraph Exit 效果
        K[fadeOut]
        L[slideOut]
        M[shrinkOut]
        N[scaleOut]
    end

    classDef effectStyle stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px
    class G,H,I,J,K,L,M,N effectStyle
```

Enter 和 Exit 效果可以使用 `+` 运算符组合：

| 效果     | Enter                                           | Exit                                              |
| -------- | ----------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------- |
| 淡入淡出 | `fadeIn()`                                      | `fadeOut()`                                       |
| 滑动     | `slideInVertically()` / `slideInHorizontally()` | `slideOutVertically()` / `slideOutHorizontally()` |
| 展开收缩 | `expandIn()` / `expandVertically()`             | `shrinkOut()` / `shrinkVertically()`              |
| 缩放     | `scaleIn()`                                     | `scaleOut()`                                      |

